            "in": "path",
            "name": "project_id",
            "minLength": 32,
            "maxLength": 64,
            "required": true,
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "description": "**参数解释**:\n实例ID。可通过查询实例列表接口ID字段获取\n**约束限制**:\n不涉及\n**取值范围**:\n以查询实例列表接口值为准,字符长度32-64。\n**默认取值**:\n不涉及",
            "in": "path",
            "name": "instance_id",
            "minLength": 32,
            "maxLength": 64,
            "required": true,
            "type": "string"
          }
